		{"id":"d261af4002c969c0","type":"text","text":"### Branching structures as pattern in nature\n* Branching pattern is present in various natural elements\n* Examples:\n\t* https://www.researchgate.net/figure/Biological-branching-structures-in-nature_fig1_321354793","x":-10543,"y":6797,"width":523,"height":243},
		{"id":"36e5a6fc452b08d9","type":"text","text":"### Shortest path: trees and roots\n* Concept: representing geometry with vertices and edges allows applying graph algorithms such as shortest path\n* Reading:\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G4KOFZejDp8\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=siL-sbLTGe8\n","x":-10580,"y":2222,"width":509,"height":232},
